WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:10.570
It's an Earthbound Immortal!

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:14.980
Its effects can negate destruction 
and halve the opponent's life points!

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:28.710
My turn!  I draw!

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:34.020
Due to Power Tool Dragon's effect, I add a 
random Equip Spell in my deck to my hand!

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:37.920
Please give me a card that will 
destroy Zeman the Ape King!

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:42.580
Here it is!

00:00:56.950 --> 00:01:01.690
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:06.790
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:11.700
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:16.470
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:21.830
No matter how bad today is

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:26.820
There's still the faintest light

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:32.220
All I have to do tomorrow

00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:36.280
Is light it myself

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:41.290
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:46.260
Even if I get countless scars

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:52.560
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:56.540
Today will never exist again

00:01:56.870 --> 00:02:02.440
So I won't stop or vanish

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:34.410
Minus CurseCaptured Ancient Fairy Dragon

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:49.180
Ancient Fairy Dragon, we'll save you.

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:50.650
Spellcaster!

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:57.260
If I remove the seal and transform Ancient 
Fairy Dragon and Regulus into minus...

00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:59.650
...their powers will be mine?

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:01.130
Exactly.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:02.800
I understand.

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:07.870
But if you're lying, you 
will be severely punished!

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:13.650
It's true!  Ancient Fairy Dragon 
will belong to you, Zeman.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:19.540
Cursed needle, free Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:30.290
Keep it up, Zeman.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:38.200
What are you waiting 
for?  Bring Regulus here!

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:46.950
The power to control the 
spirits, come to my hand!

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:48.940
Regulus, walk ahead!

00:03:55.380 --> 00:04:02.030
Ancient Fairy Dragon, I'll sever 
those chains with my fangs!

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:04.610
You're an incredible spellcaster!

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:08.320
Now Ancient Fairy Dragon belongs to Zeman!

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:16.950
Ouch!

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:23.150
Zeman, you fool!  We tricked you so easily!

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.310
What?

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:26.710
Torunka!

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:30.290
We came to rescue Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:33.450
You couldn't figure that out, you idiot?

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.800
That rod!

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:39.720
Why does he have the same rod as us?

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:41.500
Why are you saying this?

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:49.680
It's that girl from Shubank City!

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.000
She's not a spellcaster!

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.070
They found out!

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:53.650
We were so close!

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:57.170
How dare you!  You tricked me!

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:58.440
Capture them!

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:02.410
No!

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:03.410
Regulus!

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:06.850
Stop!  Capture them!

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:09.860
I won't let you have Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.960
Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.470
It's all my fault for being clumsy!

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:19.640
Luca, give me the rod!

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:21.530
What are you going to do?

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:27.860
Just like when you freed me from my curse, I'll 
combine two minuses to change it into plus energy!

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.430
But if you do that…

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.280
There will be another explosion!

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:35.280
If we don't hurry, Ancient Fairy 
Dragon will be sealed away!

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.120
Stay inside!

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:45.140
Open up!

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:46.560
I'll turn you into minus!

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:49.260
Regulus, hang in there!

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:53.260
I switch Power Tool Dragon 
to attack position!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:58.740
Power Tool Dragon, strike 
him with our greatest power!

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:04.970
I equip the Equip Spell Double 
Tool C&D to Power Tool Dragon!

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:08.280
Power Tool Dragon gains 1000 attack points!

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:14.470
I don't care if it now has the same number 
of attack points as Zeman the Ape King.

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:19.590
Since you're not a Signer, 
is that the best you can do?

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:22.060
Say whatever you want!  Battle!

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:25.960
Power Tool Dragon attacks Zeman the Ape King!

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:28.230
Zeman!

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:33.070
Stop interfering!

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:35.910
Regulus!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.130
Regulus!

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:42.810
Please return to us, Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:49.050
Are you aiming for mutual destruction?

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:50.040
No, you're not!

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:54.880
That's right!  As long as Power Tool Dragon 
has an Equip Spell, it can't be destroyed!

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:11.120
It's not over!

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:16.660
Even if I'm defeated, the 
minus curse returns to Demak!

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.460
Hooray!

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:28.940
By tributing the equipped Double Tool 
C&D, Power Tool Dragon is unharmed!

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:34.700
All right!  He finally destroyed 
a Dark Synchro monster!

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.370
No, this isn't good.

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:40.370
Why are you laughing?

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:43.290
I activate my trap Dark Matter.

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:47.040
When a Synchro Monster 
on my field is destroyed,

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:51.880
I can treat the top two cards in 
my deck as monsters and set them.

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:58.710
I equip Power Converter on Power 
Tool Dragon and end my turn!

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:11.210
Regulus?

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:12.840
Regulus?

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:15.770
Well well…

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:19.170
I'm finally able to change 
back to my original form.

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:21.780
Luca, are you hurt?

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:22.820
Who are you?

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:25.980
It's me.

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:30.190
Torunka?  You're Torunka?

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:33.520
I'm surprised!  You really were an old man!

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:37.360
Does that mean we broke the minus curse?

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.030
Luca!

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:42.870
Regulus!

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:45.010
You're safe, Regulus!

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:48.370
Zeman the Ape King has perished.

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:51.610
Really?  Where's Ancient Fairy Dragon?

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:55.240
I don't see her anywhere.

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.470
What?

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:00.400
The spirits haven't 
returned to normal either.

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:02.700
Why?  We broke the curse!

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:08.370
Zeman said that the minus 
curse was returning to Demak.

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:11.060
My turn!

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:12.460
I draw!

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:17.800
Thanks for defeating Zeman, kid.

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:18.780
What?

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:23.350
Now I have everything I need to 
summon my Earthbound Immortal card.

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:25.910
That's...

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:29.040
I tribute the two set monsters.

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:35.590
Relax.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:39.620
Since you're my opponent, 
it won't absorb your soul.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:41.760
There are plenty of other sacrifices.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:44.280
I sacrifice the souls of spirits!

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:47.500
Descend, Earthbound Immortal Cusillu!

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.270
It's coming!

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:48.900
What?

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.800
A monkey geoglyph?

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:06.530
The souls of the spirits!

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:09.150
What is going to happen?

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:13.800
Earthbound Immortal is awakening!

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:09.260
Earthbound Immortal has finally appeared!

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:12.970
This is bad!  Earthbound Immortal 
will attack him directly!

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:18.960
Earthbound Immortal Cusillu is a great god, 
so it can't be attacked by your monsters!

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:22.960
Furthermore, it's not affected 
by traps and spells!

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:24.600
No way…

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:27.830
There are eight monsters in my graveyard.

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:30.800
Due to Closed Forest's effect,

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:34.500
Earthbound Immortal Cusillu's attack 
points increase by 800 points!

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:40.920
This is what you get for foolishly 
stepping into a battle between the gods!

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:42.680
It attacks you directly!

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:46.580
If that attack succeeds, 
Lua will be defeated!

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:47.380
Lua!

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:49.390
I won't lose!

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:52.630
I activate the Equip Spell 
Power Converter's effect!

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:54.630
By sending this card to the graveyard,

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:57.130
I gain life points equal to Power 
Tool Dragon's attack points!

00:11:57.290 --> 00:12:01.060
Power Tool Dragon's attack 
points become zero this turn!

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:14.190
I can't lose...

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:18.650
If I'm defeated, Luca will be...

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:20.360
Lua?

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:21.740
Lua is in danger!

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:22.720
What?

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:28.440
We're going to be swallowed by the geoglyph!

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:32.660
If nothing changes, the spirit world 
will be trapped in eternal darkness!

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:34.020
Leave it to me!

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:34.900
Torunka?

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:38.900
I'll use my remaining strength 
to send Luca back to her world!

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:42.360
I'm counting on you to 
defeat Earthbound Immortal!

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:47.280
The future of the spirit 
world is in your hands, Luca.

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:49.750
Torunka...  Regulus…

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:03.130
What's that?

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:05.990
Luca?

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:13.070
Lua!  Pull yourself together, Lua!

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:16.880
Luca, you came back.

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:20.690
You kept fighting until you were this hurt?

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:23.270
Your opponent is a Dark Signer!

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:28.030
I was planning to beat him by 
the time you returned, Luca.

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:31.770
But I couldn't be the hero.

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:33.220
That's not true!

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:39.530
You're my greatest hero, Lua.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.250
Now all the players are here!

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:54.580
You'll fall prey to Earthbound 
Immortal Cusillu, Signer!

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:59.820
You're the one controlling Zeman the Ape 
King and stealing the spirits' souls.

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:02.330
I won't forgive you!

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:07.290
Not only did you hurt the spirits, but you 
also hurt the person I care most about!

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:12.910
Lua, I'll take over this duel.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:16.780
What are you talking about?  I 
said that I'll protect you, Luca!

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:19.230
If I don't battle, then what's the point?

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:21.470
Thank you.

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:26.440
You worked hard for me, so I'll work hard 
so that I can live up to your standards.

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:30.250
Don't do it, Luca!  If you battle 
him, you'll also be hurt!

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:32.820
I'll be fine.  Don't worry.

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:38.720
Luca…

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:47.260
Your mark!

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:53.130
The battle between the 
Signers has finally begun.

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:57.740
I won't lose because Lua and 
my friends are supporting me!

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:02.600
Let's do our best, Power Tool Dragon!

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:12.460
Even though you only have a small amount of 
life, it's still plenty enough to offer to my god!

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:18.340
To show respect to a Signer, I'll summon a 
spirit that I've been saving for a special occasion.

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:21.740
I activate the Continuous Trap Cursed Prison!

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:25.970
I can ignore the summoning 
requirements and Special Summon

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:29.370
one Synchro Monster to my 
field in defense position.

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:36.190
Appear, my prisoner!  Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:47.560
Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:50.660
I end my turn.  How do you like this?

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:55.040
You and this dragon are bound by destiny, 
but you have to face it as an enemy.

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:58.690
Ancient Fairy Dragon, just wait!

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:02.030
Lua and I will rescue you!

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:04.770
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:12.250
Due to Power Tool Dragon's effect, I add a 
random Equip Spell in my deck to my hand!

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:16.720
I equip the Equip Spell Central 
Shield on Power Tool Dragon!

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:24.250
With Central Shield, attack damage to 
monsters other than the equipped monster becomes zero!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:28.430
Even if Earthbound Immortal isn't affected 
by traps and spells, we still have a chance!

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:29.940
Well done, Luca!

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:35.260
This shield and Lua's 
feelings will protect me.

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:40.140
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:45.340
I knew you weren't willing to 
attack Ancient Fairy Dragon.

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:50.150
Earthbound Immortal can do 
more than attack you directly!

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:55.060
I'll smash your toy dragon!

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:57.700
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:02.830
Battle!  Earthbound Immortal 
Cusillu attacks Power Tool Dragon!

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:07.900
The Quick-Play Spell Limiter Removal!

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:11.680
The attack points of Machine-Type 
monsters on my field are doubled!

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:13.480
Doubled?

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:27.690
Did she do it?

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:32.450
You fools!  How dare you 
oppose the power of a god!

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:34.750
Earthbound Immortal won't be defeated!

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:39.250
By sacrificing a monster on my field, 
not only does it avoid destruction,

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:41.710
but your life points are halved!

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:45.420
That's why I summoned that!

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:48.220
I sacrifice Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:56.120
Luca!

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:58.070
Are you okay, Luca?

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:02.990
I'm fine.  Now I can finally fight for real.

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:05.730
Fight for real?

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:12.050
I knew from the start that you were planning 
to send Ancient Fairy Dragon to the graveyard.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:15.740
I'm going to get my friend back!

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:19.440
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Respect Synchron!

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:25.450
When a Synchro Monster on your field is sent 
to the graveyard due to your card's effect,

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:29.920
I can ignore its summoning requirements 
and Special Summon it to my field!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:30.890
What?

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:40.200
Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:58.410
Awesome!  You did it, Luca!

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:04.590
Ancient Fairy Dragon, we finally meet.

00:19:05.550 --> 00:19:13.290
Luca, thank you for remembering the 
promise you made a long time ago.

00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:15.650
Thank you very much.

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:23.210
That's Luca's dragon?

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:23.620
Yeah.

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:26.510
What an incredible kid.

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:29.500
But the duel isn't over yet.

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:33.190
By sending Central Shield to the graveyard,

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:37.690
I can negate Limiter Removal's effect that 
would've destroyed Power Tool Dragon.

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:41.930
Wonderful!  This is why 
real Signers are special.

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:44.230
I end my turn!

00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:48.580
Now show me how someone 
chosen by the gods duels!

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:49.740
Here we go, Lua!

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:52.140
Yeah!  It's our turn!

00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:53.450
Draw!

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:56.730
Ancient Fairy Dragon's effect!

00:19:56.730 --> 00:20:00.840
By destroying a Field Spell, 
I gain 1000 life points!

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:02.850
Field Spell?

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:08.660
You did it!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:18.070
When there's no Field Spell on the field, 
Earthbound Immortal's effect is negated.

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:19.600
Well done, Luca!

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:24.270
Then due to Power Tool Dragon's effect, 
I add one Equip Spell to my hand.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:28.700
I equip the Equip Spell Rocket 
Pilder on Power Tool Dragon

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:31.010
and Pain to Power on Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:37.810
Battle!  Power Tool Dragon 
attacks Earthbound Immortal!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:41.830
You're attacking with Power Tool Dragon 
even though it has fewer attack points?

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:52.730
Luca!

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:01.200
What are you thinking?

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:04.940
Did you choose to accept god's punishment?

00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:06.940
No way!

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:11.890
By equipping Rocket Pilder, Power Tool 
Dragon can't be destroyed in battle.

00:21:11.890 --> 00:21:16.670
And Earthbound Immortal Cusillu loses attack 
points equal to Power Tool Dragon's attack points!

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:20.890
What?

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:24.540
Since Ancient Fairy Dragon is 
equipped with Pain to Power...

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:29.730
...it gains attack points equal to the 
damage I took from Power Tool Dragon's attack!

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:33.730
My pain changes to power!

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:37.540
Ancient Fairy Dragon attacks 
Earthbound Immortal Cusillu!

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:41.240
Eternal Sunshine!

00:22:06.490 --> 00:22:10.960
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:11.320 --> 00:22:16.030
We will build our own future

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:21.470
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:21.930 --> 00:22:26.640
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:41.780
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:47.350
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:47.420 --> 00:22:52.060
Even if it loses its light

00:22:52.530 --> 00:22:57.330
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:57.330 --> 00:23:01.800
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:07.380
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:23:07.510 --> 00:23:12.230
This journey has no end

00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:17.720
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:18.150 --> 00:23:22.960
Hear my voice
